{% extends "_base_line.j2" %}
{% block extra_rules %}
- This line is Mermaid diagram source.
- Preserve node IDs, edge operators (`-->`, `---`, `-.->`), and keywords
  (`flowchart`, `graph`, `subgraph`, `end`, `classDef`, direction `TB`/`LR`).
- Translate display labels only: text inside `[...]`, `(...)`, `{...}`,
  quotes after node IDs, and edge label text `|like this|`.
- `subgraph id["中文"]` → `subgraph id["English"]` (keep `id`).
{% endblock %}
